msgid "Spotifast {version} • not affiliated with Spotify"
msgstr "Spotifast {version} • sin relación con Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:170
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"Spotify's page for your registration."
msgstr ""
"Eso no parece un Client ID. Tiene 32 letras y números, y aparece en la "
"página de Spotify de tu registro."

#: src/ui/login.rs:174
msgid ""
"Spotify doesn't know this Client ID. Copy it again from Spotify's developer "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Spotify no reconoce este Client ID. Cópialo de nuevo del panel de "
"desarrolladores de Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:178
msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use this Client ID. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that registered it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify no ha permitido que esta cuenta use este Client ID. Inicia sesión "
"con la cuenta de Spotify que lo registró, que necesita Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:182
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Spotifast used before. Register "
"Spotifast to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify ya no acepta el inicio de sesión compartido que Spotifast usaba "
"antes. Registra Spotifast para seguir escuchando."

#: src/ui/login.rs:219
msgid "A native Spotify client."
msgstr "Un cliente nativo de Spotify."

#: src/ui/login.rs:233
msgid "Waiting for Spotify in your browser…"
msgstr "Esperando a Spotify en tu navegador…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:241
msgid "Didn't open? Open the sign-in page again"
msgstr "¿No se abrió? Abre la página de inicio de sesión otra vez"

#: src/ui/login.rs:257
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your registration "
"exactly, save, and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Si Spotify dice «Invalid redirect URI», añade {uri} a tu registro tal cual, "
"guarda y vuelve a iniciar sesión."

#: src/ui/login.rs:310
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión con Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:321
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Inicia sesión desde tu navegador. Spotifast nunca ve tu contraseña. La "
"reproducción local necesita Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:330
msgid "How to register Spotifast"
msgstr "Cómo registrar Spotifast"

#: src/ui/login.rs:354
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes del proxy"

