msgstr "Buenas noches"

#: src/window.rs:12
msgid "On Wayland, use your desktop's Keep Above shortcut or window rule."
msgstr ""
"En Wayland, usa el atajo o la regla de ventana «Mantener encima» de tu "
"escritorio."

#: src/window.rs:31
msgid "Spotifast cannot open its window"
msgstr "Spotifast no puede abrir su ventana"

#: src/window.rs:34
msgid "Open page"
msgstr "Abrir página"

#: src/window.rs:51
msgid ""
"On Windows on ARM, the OpenGL that Spotifast draws with comes from "
"Microsoft's OpenCL, OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack. Open its Microsoft "
"Store page to install or repair it?"
msgstr ""
"En Windows en ARM, el OpenGL con el que Spotifast dibuja viene del OpenCL, "
"OpenGL & Vulkan Compatibility Pack de Microsoft. ¿Abrir su página de "
"Microsoft Store para instalarlo o repararlo?"

#. Translators: Keep {url} exactly as written. It becomes the address
#. of the Spotifast download page.
#: src/window.rs:58
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Spotifast needs a graphics driver with OpenGL 2.0 or newer, and this PC or "
"virtual machine does not provide one. Install the graphics driver, or turn "
"on GPU acceleration for the virtual machine. Open {url} to read more?"
msgstr ""
"Spotifast necesita un controlador gráfico con OpenGL 2.0 o posterior, y este "
"PC o máquina virtual no lo ofrece. Instala el controlador gráfico o activa "
"la aceleración por GPU de la máquina virtual. ¿Abrir {url} para saber más?"
